00:10:35.767 --> 00:10:38.067
No.

00:10:38.067 --> 00:10:40.200
-She's so lying.
Are you kidding me?

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:41.734
She's such a liar.
-Why would you stay in a hotel?

00:10:41.734 --> 00:10:43.868
