"Hey, this is cashmere."

00:11:31.133 --> 00:11:34.100
-"That's so inappropriate.
Where's your H.R. lady?"

00:11:34.100 --> 00:11:35.334
Anyways...

00:11:35.334 --> 00:11:38.200
And then, he buzzes
when he gets really happy,

00:11:38.200 --> 00:11:39.767
