under my shirt.

00:11:39.767 --> 00:11:41.534
And his ear came out
of my shirt,

00:11:41.534 --> 00:11:42.634
and the guy looks.

00:11:42.634 --> 00:11:46.801
And I went, "Look away."
And I got off.

00:11:46.801 --> 00:11:48.667
And then I put on my
"do not disturb" sign

00:11:48.667 --> 00:11:50.701
on my door for like five days.

00:11:50.701 --> 00:11:52.234
-So you did get away with it.
-I did, I did, yeah.

00:11:52.234 --> 00:11:53.734
-Oh, my. Alright. Good job.

00:11:53.734 --> 00:11:54.834
Congrats. Good on you.
-Oh, I knew.

00:11:54.834 --> 00:11:56.067
-You got points for that one.
Alright.

00:11:56.067 --> 00:11:59.334
[ Cheers and applause ]
Alright. It's my turn.

