00:12:01.334 --> 00:12:03.834
-Oh, my God.
[ Indistinct shouting ]

00:12:03.834 --> 00:12:04.968
Dude.

00:12:07.300 --> 00:12:08.300
-1.

00:12:08.300 --> 00:12:09.300
-1.
-1.

