-We'll go with 1.

00:12:10.601 --> 00:12:11.701
-Okay, be careful, 'cause I
don't want to be able

00:12:11.701 --> 00:12:12.934
to see through -- Okay.

00:12:12.934 --> 00:12:14.367
Oh, yeah, it doesn't matter.
It doesn't matter.

00:12:14.367 --> 00:12:16.501
-I'm reading it to you, yeah.
-Yeah, yeah. I got worried.

00:12:16.501 --> 00:12:20.968
-"LeBron James called me
