[ Laughter ]

00:12:30.834 --> 00:12:31.968
That's so funny.

00:12:31.968 --> 00:12:34.801
"I think it's almost
too cool...for you."

00:12:34.801 --> 00:12:36.801
Yeah.
-Okay. When?

00:12:36.801 --> 00:12:38.167
-This was probably about
four years ago.

00:12:38.167 --> 00:12:39.234
-Who were they playing?
-Oh, four years ago?

00:12:39.234 --> 00:12:40.534
-They were playing the Nuggets.

00:12:40.534 --> 00:12:42.000
Or, no, the Warriors.
The Warriors.

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:43.334
Golden State Warriors.

