00:12:45.834 --> 00:12:46.901
He was just --
-He called you.

00:12:46.901 --> 00:12:47.934
Well, he called you.
Did you answer?

00:12:47.934 --> 00:12:50.434
-Yes, I did.
-And what'd you say?

00:12:50.434 --> 00:12:51.868
-So, what happened was,
I went --

00:12:51.868 --> 00:12:53.367
-You're lying.
[ Laughter ]

00:12:53.367 --> 00:12:55.801
-Yeah, he's lying.

00:12:57.400 --> 00:12:58.667
